# ==========================================================
# LibreNMS SNMP Agent Configuration (Sanitized Example)
# 用途：跨國 NOC 戰情室 Linux / ESXi / 系統節點監控範例設定檔
# 注意：敏感 IP 與 Community 名稱皆已做去識別化 (Sanitized) 處理
# ==========================================================

# 1. 監控權限與社群字串 (Community String 替換為虛擬範例)
# 僅允許 NOC 監控伺服器網段讀取 SNMP 數據
rocommunity YOUR_READONLY_COMMUNITY_NAME  10.X.X.X/24
rocommunity YOUR_READONLY_COMMUNITY_NAME  172.X.X.X/24

# 2. 系統識別與維運聯絡資訊 (去識別化)
syslocation HQ_DataCenter_ServerRoom
syscontact IT_NOC_Team <noc-admin@company-example.com>

# 3. 系統資源存取範圍配置 (System View)
view    systemview    included   .1.3.6.1.2.1.1
view    systemview    included   .1.3.6.1.2.1.25.1.1
